Why the `=== 'auto'` check is reliable: `getItemStyle()` (src/model/mixin/makeStyleMapper.ts) only copies non-null option values, so when `progress.itemStyle.color` is unset the `fill` coming from `useStyle(data.getItemVisual(idx, 'style'))` (palette / series `itemStyle.color`) is preserved and the new branch is skipped — i.e. zero behavior change for existing options.

